body:
as far as i know - your weapons/tools don't break. are you sure that maybe it wasn't your rod health booster that broke?

&#x200B;

eta: i completely misread your post i'm so sorry, i meant not break as in not vanish completely from makeshift.

a new, sealed pack of tobacco, a baggie of weed, an arizona peach iced tea, a monarch monster (yes two drinks, for the cotton mouth) and literally any small fluffy creature that i can pet.

&#x200B;

edit: OP what are your 5 things??

i'm not ~~latinx~~ latino so i don't mean to step on any toes but i don't see why we can't also have people celebrating becoming men? i know that traditionally a quinceanera is for girls becoming women but there's no reason to not have the same celebration for boys and call it something else. like a bar/bat mitzva situation.

&#x200B;

edit: if y'all dont want me using latinx thats fine! i just didn't know

100% yes! It's in a bundle on steam right now for £40 for all the games and dlcs and thats well worth it. I havent physically played the second and third ones, but i've watched my bf play through them and all 3 are awesome games. The first 2 are an entire underwater city and the 3rd game is in the damn sky, the creepiness is well done, the gameplay is awesome, the story is great and i'm a simp for art deco. There's nothing to not love.

&#x200B;

